  "changes": [
    "Pure shared browser subpath accepts only fixed app/surface/code and validated opaque digest/reference metadata. It stores at most 50 frozen entries in current-browser memory; it has no Node, Sentry, network or durable storage dependency.",
    "Local receipt explicitly distinguishes RECORDED_LOCALLY, UNAVAILABLE and REJECTED, with remoteDelivery NOT_ATTEMPTED for this reporter only.",
    "Migrate 36 real error boundaries to local sanitized diagnostics; preserve retry and copy controls, stable hydration-safe local reference, and truthful UI wording.",
    "Remove UE global interception and both startup callers; Node startup refusal emits fixed-code structured stderr without inspecting caught values, retaining all fail-closed exits and noncritical OTel continuation.",
    "UE dashboard recovery now uses existing EN/FR errors namespace, member-safe real help route, retry and accessible home navigation; retains existing Sentry capture without asserting provider delivery and tolerates synchronous SDK failure.",
    "Retire all 12 console exception entries after actual source and regression proof. Existing console gate and expiry helper are unchanged by this batch."
  ],
